      "text": "請先儲存 WillowFrame 的修改，再離開目前視窗。",
      "languages": [
        "zh-Hant"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "technical-reading",
        "technical",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-technical-reading-14",
      "text": "這段日誌裡的 HTTP 狀態碼已經修正。",
      "languages": [
        "zh-Hant"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "technical-reading",
        "technical",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-technical-reading-15",
      "text": "在 settings.yaml 中填好路徑以後，按下儲存即可。",
      "languages": [
        "zh-Hant"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "technical-reading",
        "technical",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-technical-reading-16",
      "text": "版本 v6.3.8 只調整排版，不會刪除本機紀錄。",
      "languages": [
        "zh-Hant"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "technical-reading",
        "technical",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-01",
      "text": "界面只显示一句英文：“Bring your own cable.”，其他说明保持不变。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-02",
      "text": "系统提示 Try a different address before continuing，需要先处理这个问题。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-03",
      "text": "The parcel will arrive after sunset. 这句中文只是补充说明。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-04",
      "text": "请把下面的英文一起翻译：Leave the side door unlocked until noon.",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-05",
      "text": "这里记录了今天的变更。Keep both receipts until the payment clears.",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-06",
      "text": "报错原文是“Your seat has not been reserved.”，不要漏掉其中的否定。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-07",
      "text": "这是中文说明。次の便は明日の朝に出発します。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-08",
      "text": "中文提示后面还有一句韩文：우산은 문 옆에 놓아 주세요.",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-09",
      "text": "畫面只顯示一句英文：「Keep this receipt for your records.」，其他內容不變。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-10",
      "text": "系統提示 Choose another pickup point before paying，需要先處理這個問題。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-11",
      "text": "The library closes earlier on Fridays. 這句中文只是補充說明。",
      "languages": [],
      "tags": [
        "mixed-reading",
        "reading-holdout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-mixed-reading-12",
      "text": "請把下面的英文一起翻譯：Use the lower entrance after eight o'clock.",
